%description:
Tests the end of the AccECN option after lost ACKs (RFC 9768 section
3.2.3.2.2): a host "MAY detect loss of ACKs carrying the AccECN Option by
detecting whether the acknowledged data always reappears as a retransmission",
and then it "SHOULD disable the sending of the AccECN Option". As Linux, with
accEcnOptionPolicy="linux": the tester removes the ACK B002 and the ACK B003,
which carries the option and a D-SACK block for the retransmission A004. The
same data arrives again (A005), so the server sends no more options.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 1000; 20.0 1000"
*.*_tcp.tcpEcnMode = "accecn"
*.*_tcp.accEcnOptionPolicy = "linux"
*.*_tcp.sackSupport = true
*.tcptester.script="b2 delete; b3 delete"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.203 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A E N ack 1001 win 16384   Option(s): NOP AccECN1(e1b=1,ceb=0,e0b=1001)# deleting
[4.001 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A E N 1:1001(1000) ack 501 win 16384   Option(s): NOP AccECN1(e1b=1,ceb=0,e0b=1)
[4.003 B003] A.1000 < B.2000: A E N ack 1001 win 16384   Option(s): NOP NOP SACK[1,1001) NOP AccECN1(e1b=1,ceb=0,e0b=1001)# deleting
[10.001 A005] A.1000 > B.2000: A E N 1:1001(1000) ack 501 win 16384   Option(s): NOP AccECN1(e1b=1,ceb=0,e0b=1)
[10.003 B004] A.1000 < B.2000: A E N ack 1001 win 16384   Option(s): NOP NOP SACK[1,1001)
[20.001 A006] A.1000 > B.2000: A E N 1001:2001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 ECT(0)   Option(s): NOP AccECN1(e1b=1,ceb=0,e0b=1)
[20.203 B005] A.1000 < B.2000: A E N ack 2001 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
AccECN: the data of the D-SACK block that went with the AccECN option arrived again: no more AccECN options
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
